<title>NETHERLANDS: GRONTMIJ 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>GRONTMIJ 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>DE BILT, Netherlands 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     8.8  vs   3.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.20 vs   1.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Consultancy Grontmij NV previously said it expected a</p>
<p>profit rise in 1996.</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.62 vs   1.02</p>
<p>    Group income			 569.4  vs 535.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.5  vs  12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Grontmij said the 1996 net profit included a 1.5</p>
<p>million guilder provision for organisation restructurings which</p>
<p>will take place in the course of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
